===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Herbergen}}

# [[hostel]], [[inn]] {{gloss|accommodation for travellers, often serving breakfast and cold supper, but typically no hot food}}
#: {{uxi|de|Unsere '''Herberge''' ist einfach aber gemütlich.|Our '''hostel''' is simple but cosy.}}
#: {{syn|de|Hostel|Unterkunft}}
# [[home]], [[shelter]], place to [[sleep]]
#: {{uxi|de|Er hat keine '''Herberge'''.|He has no '''place to sleep'''.}}
#: {{syn|de|Obdach|Übernachtungsmöglichkeit|Unterkunft}}

